values ('fq_shard_001', 'The First Rite of Calming', 'story', 'D', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'GLOWVINE_FOREST', 'Elder Malakor''s voice carries the weight of someone who has heard the Shard breathing in the dark for decades. The Glowvine Forest — sacred ground where the bioluminescent vines have absorbed the Shard''s light since before the Great Severance — has grown restless. The Sprites that tend the forest in the Shard''s name are feeding on each other''s energy, an imbalance caused by the faction encroachments drawing aethel away from the sacred zones. The Children of the Shard do not hunt — they calm, they restore, they return energy to the cycle. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Elder Malakor", "location": "GLOWVINE_FOREST"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 1, "reputation_required": 0, "required_quests": []}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GLOWVINE_SPRITE", "count": 5, "description": "Calm Glowvine Sprites."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "glowvine_seed", "count": 2, "description": "Collect glowvine seed (x2). [Item: Glowvine Seed]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 50, "currency": 30, "crd": 0, "rep": 30, "items": [{"item_id": "con_small_hp_cell", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_002', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 0)
