values ('fq_shard_003', 'The Lost Are Not Evil', 'story', 'D', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'GLOWVINE_FOREST', 'Brother Silas, who walks the forest''s perimeter each dawn reciting Shard invocations against the day the Severance ends, explains: Glowvine Stalkers are not hunters by nature — they were once benign creatures of the sacred forest, corrupted when the Industrial factions began drilling near the forest''s aethel nodes. (Location: Glowvine Forest, Brother Silas) They hunt because they are in pain. They are lost because the Shard''s light has been dimmed by others'' greed. The Children do not condemn the lost. They guide them back, even if guiding requires force.', '{"npc_id": "npc_forest_acolyte", "name": "Elder Malakor", "location": "GLOWVINE_FOREST"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 2, "reputation_required": 10, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_002"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GLOWVINE_STALKER", "count": 5, "description": "Guide Glowvine Stalkers."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "glowvine_seed", "count": 2, "description": "Collect glowvine seed (x2). [Item: Glowvine Seed]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 70, "currency": 40, "crd": 0, "rep": 40, "items": [{"item_id": "dark_energy_fragment", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_004', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 2)
