values ('fq_shard_004', 'Returning What Belongs to the Cycle', 'story', 'D', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'GLOWVINE_FOREST', 'The Feral Rootlings strangling the forest floor are a symptom of the deepest wound the Children of the Shard acknowledge: energy that has been cut off from its cycle by the Severance''s ongoing aftermath, pooling and corrupting instead of flowing and nourishing. (Location: Glowvine Forest, High Priestess Lyr) Elder Malakor says the Rootlings are the forest''s attempt to hold onto energy it fears losing — a kind of grief, expressed in root and fiber. Untangle them. Return what they are hoarding to the soil. This is the Children''s most sacred act: restoration.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Elder Malakor", "location": "GLOWVINE_FOREST"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 3, "reputation_required": 15, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_003"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "FERAL_ROOTLING", "count": 5, "description": "Untangle Feral Rootlings."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "living_root", "count": 3, "description": "Collect living root (x3). [Item: Living Root]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 80, "currency": 50, "crd": 0, "rep": 50, "items": [{"item_id": "shardroot_vine", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_005', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 3)
