values ('fq_shard_007', 'Victims of Other Factions'' Greed', 'story', 'D', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'SHARDROOT_SWAMP', 'The Jungle Stalkers in the Shardroot Swamp were pushed here when OmniCorp''s extraction teams cleared their original habitat. Acolyte Mera says this with a quiet fury that only the Children seem to feel on behalf of creatures: ''The Stalkers did not choose the swamp. They were driven here by people who counted the forest as a resource, not a home.'' They are aggressive now because they are in unfamiliar territory. Pacify them — understand this as containing pain that others caused, not punishing creatures for existing.', '{"npc_id": "npc_acolyte_mera", "name": "Elder Malakor", "location": "SHARDROOT_SWAMP"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 6, "reputation_required": 25, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_006"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "JUNGLE_STALKER", "count": 5, "description": "Pacify displaced Stalkers. [Jungle Stalker]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "stalker_fang", "count": 1, "description": "Collect stalker fang (x1). [Item: Stalker Fang]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 120, "currency": 70, "crd": 0, "rep": 70, "items": [{"item_id": "animal_fang", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_008', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 6)
