values ('fq_shard_008', 'The Corruption Within the Holy', 'story', 'D', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'SHARDROOT_SWAMP', 'Elder Malakor''s theology of the Swamp Rippers is complex: they are not the Shard''s enemies — they are the Shard''s own energy, corrupted by the industrial poisons flooding the swamp. (Location: Shardroot Swamp, High Priestess Lyr) What flows through the Ripper is sacred; what has twisted it is the sin of the harvesting factions. The Children''s task in confronting them is theologically precise: separate the corruption from the vessel, release the sacred energy back to the cycle, and hold in your heart that it was not the Rippers who chose this. It never is.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Elder Malakor", "location": "SHARDROOT_SWAMP"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 7, "reputation_required": 30, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_007"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SWAMP_RIPPER", "count": 5, "description": "Purge corrupted Swamp Rippers."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "swamp_scale", "count": 2, "description": "Collect swamp scale (x2). [Item: Swamp Scale]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 180, "currency": 100, "crd": 0, "rep": 100, "items": [{"item_id": "slime_gel", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_009', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 7)
