values ('fq_shard_010', 'The Guardian That Suffers', 'story', 'D', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'SHARDROOT_SWAMP', 'Elder Malakor''s account of the Shardroot Titan is delivered with the solemnity of a eulogy: the Titan was the ancient guardian of the swamp''s sacred wells, a creature blessed by the Shard in an age before the Severance, capable of living for centuries on pure aethel energy. (Location: Shardroot Swamp, High Priestess Lyr) The industrial corruption in the swamp has poisoned it to the point where it suffers every moment it exists. The Children cannot cure it — the corruption is too deep. What they can offer, through the mercy of combat, is release. This is the hardest task: giving peace to what you love by letting it go.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Elder Malakor", "location": "SHARDROOT_SWAMP"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 9, "reputation_required": 40, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_009"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SHARDROOT_TITAN", "count": 2, "description": "Purify Shardroot Titans."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "ancient_root_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect ancient root core (x1). [Item: Ancient Root Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 300, "currency": 180, "crd": 0, "rep": 180, "items": [{"item_id": "core_fragment", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_011', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 9)
