values ('fq_shard_011', 'Where the Shard Still Breathes', 'story', 'C', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'FRAGMENT_SHRINE', 'The Fragment Shrine holds pieces of the original Aethel Shard — not metaphorical fragments, but literal shards of the divine object the Children believe shattered intentionally in the Great Severance, distributing its consciousness across Xylos to survive. Elder Malakor has been waiting for someone with your demonstrated devotion to make the pilgrimage. The Shrine is not a monument. It is where the Shard still breathes, in slow divine cycles that the Arcanum Seekers would call ''residual harmonic emissions.'' The Children know better. Quest giver: Keeper Norn at Fragment Shrine.', '{"npc_id": "npc_shrine_keeper", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "FRAGMENT_SHRINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 10, "reputation_required": 45, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_010"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "FRAGMENT_SHRINE", "count": 1, "description": "Make pilgrimage to the Fragment Shrine."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "specter_essence", "count": 2, "description": "Collect specter essence (x2). [Item: Specter Essence]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 280, "currency": 150, "crd": 0, "rep": 150, "items": [{"item_id": "con_minor_stim_pack", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_012', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 10)
