values ('fq_shard_012', 'The Worthy Prove Themselves', 'story', 'C', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'FRAGMENT_SHRINE', 'Oracle Seraphel explains the Shrine Wardens with theological precision: they are not guardians in the military sense — they are the Shard''s own test, given form. Every faction that has tried to claim the Fragment Shrine for their own purposes has been turned away by the Wardens, because the Shard does not yield its fragments to those who would harvest them. The worthy approach differently — not to take, but to receive. The Warden trial is the difference. Face it with the intention the Shard can sense. Quest giver: Keeper Norn at Fragment Shrine.', '{"npc_id": "npc_shrine_keeper", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "FRAGMENT_SHRINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 11, "reputation_required": 50, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_011"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SHRINE_WARDEN", "count": 5, "description": "Face the Shrine Warden trial."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "aethel_fragment", "count": 2, "description": "Collect aethel fragment (x2). [Item: Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 320, "currency": 170, "crd": 0, "rep": 170, "items": [{"item_id": "memory_fragment_chip", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_013', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 11)
