values ('fq_shard_015', 'The Shard Receives What Is Given Freely', 'story', 'C', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'FRAGMENT_SHRINE', 'Elder Malakor''s instructions for the Shrine Offering are careful and specific: the offering must be given freely, without expectation of return, or the Shard will not receive it. (Location: Fragment Shrine, High Priestess Lyr) This is the doctrine that divides the Children from every other faction on Xylos — everyone else takes from Xylos; the Children give. The offering ritual requires defending the Shrine during the giving, because the Wardens respond to the energy flow. This is understood. The giving continues despite the trial, or it is not a real offering.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "FRAGMENT_SHRINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 14, "reputation_required": 65, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_014"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "collect", "target": "mystic_spore", "count": 4, "description": "Collect mystic spore (x4). [Item: Mystic Spore]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "SHRINE_WARDEN", "count": 4, "description": "Defend the offering ritual. [Shrine Warden]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 500, "currency": 280, "crd": 0, "rep": 300, "items": [{"item_id": "sprite_dust", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_016', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 14)
