values ('fq_shard_018', 'The Discordant Voice', 'story', 'C', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'FRAGMENT_SHRINE', 'Elder Malakor identifies the Resonance Echo that has appeared at the Fragment Shrine as something specific and troubling: it is not Aethelgardian in origin. Its frequency is discordant with the Shrine''s harmonics in a way that suggests it is drawing from a different source entirely — something older, or something that came from outside Xylos. The Concordium would call this a signal anomaly. The Arcanum would call this a research opportunity. The Children of the Shard call it an intrusion that must be harmonized. Combat is the instrument the Shard has left them. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "FRAGMENT_SHRINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 17, "reputation_required": 80, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_017"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "RESONANCE_ECHO", "count": 1, "description": "Harmonize the Resonance Echo."}, {"type": "kill", "target": "SHRINE_GUARDIAN", "count": 2, "description": "Clear Guardian escorts. [Shrine Guardian]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 800, "currency": 450, "crd": 0, "rep": 450, "items": [{"item_id": "entropy_core", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_019', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 17)
