values ('fq_shard_019', 'A Place Among the Faithful', 'story', 'C', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'FRAGMENT_SHRINE', 'Oracle Seraphel has communed with the Shard three times in the past week, seeking its guidance on what you have done at the Fragment Shrine. The final trial is not a test of strength — it is a final declaration of intention. Every Warden and Avenger that rises in this last sweep is the Shard''s way of asking: are you still here? Are you still committed? The Children who pass this trial do not receive a title or a rank. They receive something the other factions cannot manufacture: the knowledge that the Shard has recognized them. Quest giver: Keeper Norn at Fragment Shrine.', '{"npc_id": "npc_shrine_keeper", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "FRAGMENT_SHRINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 18, "reputation_required": 85, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_018"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SHRINE_WARDEN", "count": 4, "description": "Final Warden trial. [Shrine Warden]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "SHRINE_AVENGER", "count": 4, "description": "Final Avenger trial. [Shrine Avenger]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "aethel_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect aethel fragment (x1). [Item: Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 900, "currency": 500, "crd": 0, "rep": 500, "items": [{"item_id": "con_medium_hp_cell", "quantity": 5}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_020', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 18)
