values ('fq_shard_020', 'The Sanctum Opens Its Inner Chamber', 'story', 'C', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'SANCTUM', 'Elder Malakor has personally requested your return to the Sanctum. This is not a common occurrence — in the Children of the Shard, Elder Malakor''s personal invitations are themselves considered sacred acts. The Advanced Attunement ceremony opens your connection to the Shard''s deeper frequencies, the ones that the Fragment Shrine''s outer fragments only hint at. Oracle Seraphel will witness it. What awaits you at the Heartwood Altar will require everything the Shard has given you, and more of what you have given the Shard. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "SANCTUM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 19, "reputation_required": 90, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_019"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "SANCTUM", "count": 1, "description": "Return to the Sanctum."}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 900, "currency": 500, "crd": 0, "rep": 500, "items": [{"item_id": "con_medium_mp_cell", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_021', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 19)
