values ('fq_shard_024', 'Decommissioning the Harvesters', 'story', 'B', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'HEARTWOOD_ALTAR', 'Titan Forge Automatons — Iron Hegemony construction machines abandoned here during a failed incursion attempt three seasons ago — are still operating in the Heartwood Altar''s outer ring, drilling for the mineral deposits the Hegemony wanted. Oracle Seraphel''s outrage at this is theological: the Heartwood Altar is the Shard''s body. The Hegemony''s machines are harvesting from a sleeping god. Decommission them. Not with the Hegemony''s language of tactical necessity, but with the Children''s language of sacred duty: this ground is not for taking. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "HEARTWOOD_ALTAR"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 24, "reputation_required": 125, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_023"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "TITAN_FORGE_AUTOMATON", "count": 2, "description": "Decommission Automatons. [Titan Forge Automaton]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "titan_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect titan core (x1). [Item: Titan Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 1800, "currency": 900, "crd": 270, "rep": 560, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 10}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_025', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 23)
