values ('fq_shard_027', 'Riding the Shard''s Lightning', 'story', 'B', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'AETHEL_STORM_BELT', 'Storm Rift Serpents are creatures that exist at the interface between the physical world and the electromagnetic field the Shard generates — the Children''s texts call them ''the Shard''s weather, given spine and scale.'' They are not hostile by nature; they are hostile because the other factions'' presence in the Storm Belt disrupts the electromagnetic currents they navigate by. (Location: Aethel Storm Belt, High Priestess Lyr) The Arcanum wants to study them. The Concordium wants to neutralize them. The Children''s approach is older and more demanding: communion, through whatever contact the Shard allows.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "AETHEL_STORM_BELT"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 26, "reputation_required": 155, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_026"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "STORM_RIFT_SERPENT", "count": 3, "description": "Commune with Serpents. [Storm Rift Serpent]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "storm_core", "count": 2, "description": "Collect storm core (x2). [Item: Storm Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 1900, "currency": 950, "crd": 285, "rep": 590, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 10}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_028', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 26)
