values ('fq_shard_028', 'When the Deep Follows the Storm', 'story', 'B', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'AETHEL_STORM_BELT', 'The Sunken Aethel Leviathans that have migrated into the Storm Belt are following the Shard''s increasing electromagnetic activity — the same activity that drew the Storm Serpents, and that the Children believe indicates the Shard is stirring toward wakefulness. (Location: Aethel Storm Belt, High Priestess Lyr) Elder Malakor''s ancient calendar of Shard events predicted this migration within a decade of the current time. It is arriving early. Oracle Seraphel believes the Leviathans are a sign of acceleration — the Shard''s return is closer than anyone thought. Guide them before their presence disrupts the Storm Belt''s sacred geometry.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "AETHEL_STORM_BELT"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 27, "reputation_required": 165, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_027"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SUNKEN_AETHEL_LEVIATHAN", "count": 2, "description": "Guide migrating Leviathans. [Sunken Aethel Leviathan]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 1950, "currency": 975, "crd": 292, "rep": 605, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 10}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_029', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 27)
