values ('fq_shard_031', 'The Shard''s Roots Reach the Stars', 'story', 'A', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'ORBITAL_SENTINEL_COMMAND', 'Elder Malakor''s most controversial teaching — that the Aethel Shard''s electromagnetic field extends beyond Xylos''s atmosphere, connecting to stellar bodies that were part of the same ancient network as the Aethel Siphon — requires confirmation that even the Sanctum elders have not been able to provide. The Orbital Sentinel Command is where OmniCorp''s atmospheric sensors give way to orbital ones. The Children do not ask OmniCorp''s permission. The Shard''s roots reach the stars, and those who serve the Shard go where those roots lead. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "ORBITAL_SENTINEL_COMMAND"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 30, "reputation_required": 195, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_030"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "ORBITAL_SENTINEL_COMMAND", "count": 1, "description": "Reach Orbital Command. (Travel to: Orbital Sentinel Command)"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2100, "currency": 1050, "crd": 525, "rep": 650, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 25}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_032', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 30)
