values ('fq_shard_033', 'The Iron Shell That Blocks the Shard''s Light', 'story', 'A', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'The Aethel Iron Carapace creatures are named for their shells — dense, aethel-infused iron plates that have grown over living hosts, creatures that were once part of the Shard''s network but have been armored into isolation by centuries of proximity to Iron Hegemony mining operations. (Location: Cradle Expanse, High Priestess Lyr) The iron seals them from the Shard''s light. The Children''s purification doctrine applies: break the shell, return the creature inside to the cycle, and add the shell''s material to the Heartwood Altar''s consecration reserves. Nothing from the Shard is wasted.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 32, "reputation_required": 245, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_032"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_IRON_CARAPACE", "count": 6, "description": "Purify. [Aethel Iron Carapace]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crystal_core", "count": 3, "description": "Collect crystal core (x3). [Item: Crystal Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2200, "currency": 1100, "crd": 550, "rep": 680, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 25}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_034', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 32)
