values ('fq_shard_035', 'What the Abyss Sends Against the Shard', 'story', 'A', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'The Aethel Abyssal Reavers are, in the Children''s theology, the most direct manifestation of what the Great Severance unleashed — void energy that entered the world through the Siphon''s shattering and has been taking form ever since, directly opposed to the Shard''s sacred light. (Location: Cradle Expanse, High Priestess Lyr) They are not corrupted — they are the corruption itself, given body. Elder Malakor calls this an exorcism because that is the oldest word the Children have for it: expelling the void from sacred ground because the Shard''s ground cannot hold what is antithetical to its nature.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 34, "reputation_required": 295, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_034"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 4, "description": "Exorcise. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "void_channeler_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect void channeler core (x1). [Item: Void Channeler Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2300, "currency": 1150, "crd": 558, "rep": 710, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 25}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_036', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 34)
