values ('fq_shard_037', 'Redemption Through the Drake''s Fire', 'story', 'A', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'The Ashen Drake''s fire is, in the Children''s oldest symbolism, the Shard''s own cleansing heat — the same fire that the Severance released into the world, now bound in an ancient creature that has carried it for centuries without understanding what it carries. (Location: Cradle Expanse, High Priestess Lyr) Elder Malakor says: to defeat the Drake is not to extinguish the fire but to return it, through the Drake''s death, to the Shard that originally generated it. This is redemption in the Children''s theology: not forgiveness, but completion. The fire comes home.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 36, "reputation_required": 345, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_036"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "ASHEN_DRAKE", "count": 1, "description": "Redeem. [Ashen Drake]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "drake_heart", "count": 1, "description": "Collect drake heart (x1). [Item: Drake Heart]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2400, "currency": 1200, "crd": 582, "rep": 740, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 25}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_038', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 36)
