values ('fq_shard_038', 'Every Corner of the Expanse Must Be Heard', 'story', 'A', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'The Expanse''s purification is not a single act — it is an ongoing commitment that Oracle Seraphel believes the Children must maintain until the Shard''s awakening makes it unnecessary. (Location: Cradle Expanse, High Priestess Lyr) The Aethel Iron Carapace creatures that have colonized the Expanse''s western sectors are preventing the Shard''s signal from reaching that region at all, creating a dead zone in the electromagnetic network that Elder Malakor calls ''deafness in the sacred body.'' The Children of the Shard do not permit the Shard to be made deaf. Not one corner of the Expanse.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 37, "reputation_required": 370, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_037"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_IRON_CARAPACE", "count": 8, "description": "Sweep. [Aethel Iron Carapace]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crystal_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect crystal core (x1). [Item: Crystal Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2450, "currency": 1225, "crd": 612, "rep": 755, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 25}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_039', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 37)
