values ('fq_shard_041', 'Into the Shard''s First Wound', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Elder Malakor calls the Void Echo Chasm ''the wound that never closed'' — the scar in Xylos''s body left by the Great Severance''s first catastrophic rupture, where the Aethel Siphon''s overload tore through the planet''s aethel substrate like a blade. The Shard fell silent here first. The void entered here first. Oracle Seraphel''s vision says the key to the Shard''s full awakening lies at the bottom of this wound. You will descend where no Child of the Shard has fully descended. Go with everything the Shard has given you. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 40, "reputation_required": 445, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_040"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM", "count": 1, "description": "Enter the Chasm. (Travel to: Void Echo Chasm)"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 3, "description": "Collect core fragment (x3). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2600, "currency": 1300, "crd": 630, "rep": 800, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_042', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 40)
