values ('fq_shard_048', 'The Shattered Heart Opens to You', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Oracle Seraphel''s final vision before she fell silent for three days: you standing at the threshold of the Shattered Heart — the zone at Xylos''s geological center where the Severance''s impact was most catastrophic, where the planet''s own aethel core cracked. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, High Priestess Lyr) She saw you cross it. She does not know what you will find there, and she says this with an honesty the Children find both frightening and reverent. What the Shard has not shown its prophet is either beyond prophecy or beyond even the Shard''s own knowledge. Enter and discover which it is.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 47, "reputation_required": 795, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_047"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "SHATTERED_HEART", "count": 1, "description": "Enter. (Travel to: Shattered Heart, Shattered Heart)"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 2950, "currency": 1475, "crd": 714, "rep": 905, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_049', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 47)
