values ('fq_shard_049', 'The Drake That Never Found Rest', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'SHATTERED_HEART', 'In the Shattered Heart, an Ashen Drake has made its lair — an ancient creature that Elder Malakor''s scripture identifies as the last surviving Drake of the Aethelgardian age, kept alive by proximity to the Severance''s ongoing energy release. It has been burning for centuries without rest, carrying a fire that was never supposed to last this long. The Children''s doctrine of mercy is the most demanding it has ever been here: to give this creature the rest it has not found in centuries of unending fire. This is not combat. This is completion. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "SHATTERED_HEART"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 49, "reputation_required": 845, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_048"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "ASHEN_DRAKE", "count": 1, "description": "Guide to rest. [Ashen Drake]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "DRAKE_MINION", "count": 5, "description": "Clear Minions. [Drake Minion]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3050, "currency": 1525, "crd": 738, "rep": 935, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_050', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 48)
