values ('fq_shard_050', 'The Shadows the Wound Casts', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'The Void Stalker that hunts the Chasm''s mid-levels is one of the oldest void entities on Xylos — old enough that the Children''s scripture actually names it, calling it ''the Shadow the Wound Casts,'' a semi-autonomous fragment of the Severance''s original void eruption given consciousness over centuries. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, High Priestess Lyr) Soul Fragmenters cluster around it, feeding on the soul-echoes it disturbs. Oracle Seraphel says ending the Shadow is the midpoint of the Chasm''s cleansing — everything before this was preparation. Everything after is the Shard''s final work.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 50, "reputation_required": 895, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_049"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SOUL_FRAGMENTER", "count": 3, "description": "Cleanse. [Soul Fragmenter]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "VOID_STALKER", "count": 1, "description": "Cleanse Stalker. [Void Stalker]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3100, "currency": 1550, "crd": 750, "rep": 950, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_051', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 49)
