values ('fq_shard_052', 'The Stalker the Shard Cannot See', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'A Void Stalker has positioned itself in the precise electromagnetic blind spot created by the Chasm''s original fracture — the place where the Severance''s detonation bent the Shard''s perception around a point of absolute void density. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, High Priestess Lyr) The Shard literally cannot see this zone, which is why the Stalker has survived every Children-led purge attempt. Oracle Seraphel says the only way in is through what the Shard cannot see. That means going where the Shard cannot protect you. Face it with what you''ve carried from the Shard''s teaching.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 52, "reputation_required": 995, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_051"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "VOID_STALKER", "count": 1, "description": "Exorcise. [Void Stalker]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3200, "currency": 1600, "crd": 774, "rep": 980, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_053', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 51)
