values ('fq_shard_053', 'The Severance Moment Must Finally End', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Three Chrono Wraiths have anchored themselves to specific temporal fault points in the Chasm — nodes where the Severance moment is still replaying in localized time loops that feed them continuously. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, High Priestess Lyr) Elder Malakor''s oldest texts predicted this: ''The Wound will sustain what feeds on its opening, until the opening is healed.'' Banishing all three Wraiths does not just clear the Chasm — it allows the temporal loops to collapse, permitting the Severance moment to finally finish happening rather than replaying forever. This is the healing the Shard has been waiting for.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 53, "reputation_required": 1045, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_052"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CHRONO_WRAITH", "count": 3, "description": "Harmonize. [Chrono Wraith]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3250, "currency": 1625, "crd": 786, "rep": 995, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_054', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 52)
