values ('fq_shard_055', 'The Mountains Must Sleep', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Three Gigantic Jotunns have descended into the Chasm''s lower levels — ancient creatures drawn by the seismic activity the Children''s purification work has triggered in the wound. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, High Priestess Lyr) They are not void entities; they are geological, elemental, older than the Shard''s recorded history. But their presence in the healing zone creates energetic interference that prevents the wound from closing. Elder Malakor says, gently and with great respect for the age of these creatures: ''The mountains must sleep before the wound can heal.'' Send them back to the deep stone.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 55, "reputation_required": 1145, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_054"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 3, "description": "Guide to slumber. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3350, "currency": 1675, "crd": 810, "rep": 1025, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_056', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 54)
