values ('fq_shard_056', 'A Tyrant That Ruled the Wound', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Crystal Tyrants — crystalline behemoths that the Shard created to guard its most concentrated energy nodes — have been corrupted by the Chasm''s void saturation into something the Children''s theology calls ''tyrants rather than guardians'': creatures whose protective impulse has curdled into dominance, guarding not what they were meant to guard but claiming the void energy as their own kingdom. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, High Priestess Lyr) Oracle Seraphel says harmonizing them means breaking the tyranny without breaking the creature — returning the guardian''s original purpose through the only instrument still available.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 56, "reputation_required": 1195, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_055"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRYSTAL_TYRANT", "count": 2, "description": "Harmonize. [Crystal Tyrant]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3400, "currency": 1700, "crd": 822, "rep": 1040, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_057', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 55)
