values ('fq_shard_057', 'The Harbinger''s Shadow Precedes It', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'The Abyss Harbinger has not yet entered the Chasm — but its shadow has. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, High Priestess Lyr) Oracle Seraphel can feel the distortion its approach creates in the Shard''s field: a cold compression, like a divine exhalation held too long. The Abyssal Reavers that have swarmed the Chasm in the past day are its scouts, its preparation, the void making room for what comes. A Chrono Wraith has anchored itself to the entry point, maintaining a time-lock that will hold the Harbinger''s passage open when it arrives. Break the lock. Cut through the scouts. Prepare for what follows.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 57, "reputation_required": 1245, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_056"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 6, "description": "Cut through. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "CHRONO_WRAITH", "count": 1, "description": "Banish Wraith. [Chrono Wraith]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "abyssal_reaver_claw", "count": 1, "description": "Collect abyssal reaver claw (x1). [Item: Abyssal Reaver Claw]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3450, "currency": 1725, "crd": 834, "rep": 1055, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_058', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 56)
