values ('fq_shard_058', 'What the Harbinger''s Approach Feeds', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'The Harbinger''s approach is feeding the Soul Fragmenters in the Chasm to a level the Children have not seen before — they are harvesting soul-fragments with frantic intensity, as if storing them for something. (Location: Void Echo Chasm, High Priestess Lyr) A Void Stalker is coordinating their feeding, directing them with tactical precision that no Fragmenter is capable of on its own. Elder Malakor says the Harbinger is trying to collect what it needs for its arrival: the Severance''s unclaimed souls, harvested and consumed before the Shard can reclaim them. Stop the harvest. Stop the Stalker.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 58, "reputation_required": 1295, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_057"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "SOUL_FRAGMENTER", "count": 3, "description": "Harvest. [Soul Fragmenter]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "VOID_STALKER", "count": 1, "description": "Cleanse Stalker. [Void Stalker]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3500, "currency": 1750, "crd": 846, "rep": 1070, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_059', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 57)
