values ('fq_shard_061', 'Healing the Shard''s Oldest Wound', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE', 'Along the Severance Faultline, the Aethel Iron Carapace creatures have built colonies in the exposed aethel substrate — feeding directly from the Shard''s deep healing efforts, consuming the energy the Shard is trying to use to reconnect across the faultline. Elder Malakor says this is the most literal form of the sin the Children condemn: taking from the Shard while it tries to heal. Clear them from the faultline sectors. Return the substrate to the Shard''s use. The oldest wound must be allowed to close. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 61, "reputation_required": 1445, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_060"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_IRON_CARAPACE", "count": 8, "description": "Heal. [Aethel Iron Carapace]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "carapace_fragment", "count": 3, "description": "Collect carapace fragment (x3). [Item: Carapace Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3650, "currency": 1825, "crd": 882, "rep": 1115, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_062', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 60)
