values ('fq_shard_062', 'When Guardians Rule What They Should Protect', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE', 'Crystal Tyrants along the Faultline are guarding the aethel substrate nodes that the Shard''s deep roots are trying to reach — not protecting the substrate but controlling it, channeling its energy into their own crystalline mass rather than allowing it to flow toward the Shard''s reconnection effort. (Location: Severance Faultline, High Priestess Lyr) Oracle Seraphel says the corruption here is subtle and specifically theological: these were guardians who decided, at some point in the centuries since the Severance, that guarding was the same as owning. Ground them. Return the substrate''s energy to the Shard.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 62, "reputation_required": 1495, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_061"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "CRYSTAL_TYRANT", "count": 2, "description": "Ground. [Crystal Tyrant]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 1, "description": "Collect monster material (x1). [Item: Monster Material]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3700, "currency": 1850, "crd": 894, "rep": 1130, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_063', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 61)
