values ('fq_shard_064', 'The Earth Remembers What Was One', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE', 'Elder Malakor describes the Faultline''s final stabilization as ''the earth remembering what was one'' — the moment when the aethel substrate on both sides of the Severance scar begins to recognize each other again, the way fractured bone recognizes its other half as the healing begins. (Location: Severance Faultline, High Priestess Lyr) The Jotunns still present are the last physical interference. Oracle Seraphel says the materials collected from the Faultline zone, combined with the Jotunn''s displacement, will allow the Shard''s deep roots to make contact across the scar for the first time since the Great Severance. Finish this.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "SEVERANCE_FAULTLINE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 64, "reputation_required": 1595, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_063"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "collect", "target": "monster_material", "count": 3, "description": "Collect monster material (x3). [Item: Monster Material]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 1, "description": "Bind. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3800, "currency": 1900, "crd": 918, "rep": 1160, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_065', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 63)
