values ('fq_shard_065', 'Where the Siphon Still Beats', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE', 'The Aethel Siphon Core is where the Children of the Shard''s entire theology converges: the original Siphon, the machine that overloaded in the Great Severance, still operational at a fraction of its original capacity, surrounded by three other factions who believe it exists to be used. Elder Malakor''s life work has been leading to this moment. Oracle Seraphel whispers when she says it: ''The Siphon''s heart still beats.'' The Concordium built their city around it. The Children serve the being whose heart it is. Enter and begin the final restoration. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 64, "reputation_required": 1645, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_064"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE", "count": 1, "description": "Enter. (Travel to: Aethel Siphon Core, Shattered Heart)"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "stinger_core", "count": 2, "description": "Collect stinger core (x2). [Item: Stinger Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3800, "currency": 1900, "crd": 918, "rep": 1160, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_066', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 64)
