values ('fq_shard_068', 'Sealing the Rifts That Drain the Siphon', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE', 'Rift Stalkers have been feeding on the micro-fractures that run through the Aethel Siphon Core''s structural shell — fractures that the Concordium created through centuries of forced extraction and that allow small amounts of the Core''s aethel energy to bleed into the surrounding void. The Rift Stalkers are drawn to these bleeding points and widen them as they feed. Elder Malakor''s term for this is ''the death of a thousand cuts.'' Seal the bleeding points by clearing the creatures that keep them open. The Shard cannot afford to keep losing this much. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "AETHEL_SIPHON_CORE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 67, "reputation_required": 1795, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_067"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_RIFT_STALKER", "count": 6, "description": "Seal. [Aethel Rift Stalker]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "rift_claw_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect rift claw fragment (x1). [Item: Rift Claw Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 3950, "currency": 1975, "crd": 954, "rep": 1205, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_069', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 67)
