values ('fq_shard_071', 'Where Prima Materia Is Forged', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE', 'The Prima Materia Forge is where the Iron Hegemony has been attempting to recreate the Aethelgardians'' most advanced material science — using the Shard''s own geological energy to forge a substance that was, in the original Aethelgardian texts, only ever created by the Shard itself. Elder Malakor calls this ''the final blasphemy'': turning the Shard''s body into a manufacturing process. The Children of the Shard must enter this Forge — not to cooperate with it, but to reclaim what has been taken from the Shard''s geological domain and restore it to its rightful cycle. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 70, "reputation_required": 1945, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_070"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE", "count": 1, "description": "Enter. (Travel to: Prima Materia Forge, Shattered Heart)"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crystal_tyrant_core", "count": 2, "description": "Collect crystal tyrant core (x2). [Item: Crystal Tyrant Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4100, "currency": 2050, "crd": 990, "rep": 1250, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_072', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 70)
