values ('fq_shard_072', 'The Forge That Burns What the Shard Made', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE', 'The Aethel Iron Carapace creatures that have colonized the Prima Materia Forge''s outer processing rings are feeding on the raw Prima Materia that the Hegemony''s machines are extracting — consuming sacred material that was made over millions of years by the Shard''s geological activity. Oracle Seraphel says this is the most concentrated form of the sin the Children oppose: the Hegemony is not just harvesting the Shard''s body, it is creating conditions where other creatures harvest it too, in a cascade of taking that the Shard cannot sustain. Clear the Carapace. Stop the cascade. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 71, "reputation_required": 1995, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_071"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_IRON_CARAPACE", "count": 8, "description": "Purify. [Aethel Iron Carapace]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "crystal_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect crystal core (x1). [Item: Crystal Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4150, "currency": 2075, "crd": 1002, "rep": 1265, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_073', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 71)
