values ('fq_shard_073', 'Reclaiming What Was Taken to the Forge', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE', 'The Aethel Abyssal Reavers that have followed the Prima Materia Forge''s energy signature into the deep Forge zone are, in Oracle Seraphel''s vision, the void''s attempt to claim the Shard''s most sacred material for itself — the same void that entered Xylos through the Severance, now drawn to the purest concentration of Shard-made substance on the planet. If the void claims Prima Materia, it gains something the Children''s theology has no name for: a foothold in the Shard''s geological will itself. Stop this exorcism before that name needs to be invented. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 72, "reputation_required": 2045, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_072"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 8, "description": "Cleanse. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_VOID_CHANNELER", "count": 5, "description": "Purify. [Aethel Void Channeler]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4200, "currency": 2100, "crd": 1014, "rep": 1280, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_074', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 72)
