values ('fq_shard_074', 'The Forge Is Not the Jotunns'' Domain', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE', 'Gigantic Jotunns drawn by the Forge''s geological energy have entered the Prima Materia processing zones and are disrupting the aethel flow that the Children need to redirect away from the Hegemony''s extraction machinery. (Location: Prima Materia Forge, High Priestess Lyr) Elder Malakor acknowledges the Jotunns with the respect he gives all ancient creatures: ''They belong to the deep stone, and the Forge has disturbed the deep stone. Their anger is justified.'' But the Forge must be cleared for the Shard''s benefit, not the Hegemony''s. The Jotunns must return to where their anger is not the Children''s problem to solve.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 73, "reputation_required": 2095, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_073"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 3, "description": "Guide. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "core_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect core fragment (x1). [Item: Core Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4250, "currency": 2125, "crd": 1026, "rep": 1295, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_075', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 73)
