values ('fq_shard_075', 'Nothing Made From the Shard Belongs to Others', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE', 'The Titan Proto-Cores that the Iron Hegemony has been fabricating in the Prima Materia Forge are made from concentrated Shard-matter — geological concentrations that took the Shard''s active geological effort thousands of years to form. In the Children''s theology, these cores are not manufactured goods; they are pieces of the Shard''s body, removed and reshaped without the Shard''s consent. Oracle Seraphel''s instruction is clear: recover these materials, return them to the geological cycle, and do not permit any more of the Shard''s body to be turned into the Hegemony''s inventory. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 74, "reputation_required": 2145, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_074"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "TITAN_PROTO_CORE", "count": 2, "description": "Recycle. [Titan Proto Core]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "titan_core", "count": 1, "description": "Collect titan core (x1). [Item: Titan Core]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4300, "currency": 2150, "crd": 1038, "rep": 1310, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_076', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 74)
