values ('fq_shard_076', 'The Trial That Makes a Legend', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE', 'Elder Malakor calls this the Trial of Legend — the point in a Children''s devotional path where the Shard tests not just skill or commitment but the ability to hold both simultaneously against a creature that tests both absolutely. The Gravity Titan in the Prima Materia Forge has reached the inner processing core, where the Shard''s most concentrated geological energy is held. It is not void-corrupted, not evil, simply massive and territorial and positioned at the exact place the Children need access to. A legend is someone who moves the unmovable for the right reason. Be that. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 75, "reputation_required": 2195, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_075"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GRAVITY_TITAN", "count": 1, "description": "Guide Titan. [Gravity Titan]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "ABYSS_HARBINGER", "count": 1, "description": "Guide Harbinger. [Abyss Harbinger]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4350, "currency": 2175, "crd": 1050, "rep": 1325, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 1}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_077', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 75)
