values ('fq_shard_077', 'The Legend Completes the Cycle', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE', 'Oracle Seraphel''s final vision before the Sanctum''s inner circle receives your return: you completing the Prima Materia Forge''s cleansing and returning the last of the Shard''s extracted geological material to the sacred cycle, through the ritual that Elder Malakor designed and that has never been performed because no one has ever reached this point before. The Legend does not end with the final battle; it ends with the final offering — walking back to the Sanctum carrying what the Shard asked you to carry, having done what the Shard asked you to do. The legend is in the completion. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "PRIMA_MATERIA_FORGE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 76, "reputation_required": 2245, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_076"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "SANCTUM", "count": 1, "description": "Return. (Travel to: Sanctum)"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "raw_aethel_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect raw aethel fragment (x1). [Item: Raw Aethel Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 4400, "currency": 2200, "crd": 1062, "rep": 1340, "items": [{"item_id": "aethel_core_shard", "quantity": 2}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_078', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 76)
