values ('fq_shard_079', 'The Shard''s Work Is Never Finished', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'CRADLE_EXPANSE', 'Oracle Seraphel says what she has always said when new waves of Abyssal Reavers enter the Expanse: ''The Shard''s work is never finished while the void still reaches for what the Shard made.'' The Children do not ask how long. (Location: Cradle Expanse, High Priestess Lyr) They ask how many. The answer is always: as many as the Shard requires. The Expanse''s aethel network must remain clear. This is the Children''s endless covenant with the sleeping god they serve.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "CRADLE_EXPANSE"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 78, "reputation_required": 2345, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_078"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "AETHEL_ABYSSAL_REAVER", "count": 5, "description": "Sacred duty. [Aethel Abyssal Reaver]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 5000, "currency": 2500, "crd": 1250, "rep": 2000, "items": [], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_080', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 78)
