values ('fq_shard_099', 'The Last Mountain Before the Final Resonance', 'story', 'S', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'VOID_ECHO_CHASM', 'Elder Malakor''s eyes are bright when he describes what Oracle Seraphel has seen: the Void Echo Chasm''s final clearing is almost complete. One more Gigantic Jotunn remains in the deepest accessible layer, settled in the zone where the temporal fractures have been healing since the Chrono Wraith banishments. The Jotunn is not malevolent; it is geological, ancient, and drawn to the healing energy now emanating from the wound''s repaired zones. But it blocks the last passage. Move it. The Final Resonance awaits beyond. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "VOID_ECHO_CHASM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 98, "reputation_required": 3345, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_098"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "kill", "target": "GIGANTIC_JOTUNN", "count": 1, "description": "Harmonize Jotunn. [Gigantic Jotunn]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "ASHEN_DRAKE", "count": 1, "description": "Harmonize Drake. [Ashen Drake]"}, {"type": "kill", "target": "ABYSS_HARBINGER", "count": 1, "description": "Harmonize Harbinger. [Abyss Harbinger]"}, {"type": "collect", "target": "abyss_fragment", "count": 1, "description": "Collect abyss fragment (x1). [Item: Abyss Fragment]"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 25000, "currency": 12000, "crd": 6000, "rep": 8000, "items": [{"item_id": "resonanted_astral_phase_crystal", "quantity": 3}], "reputation": 50}'::jsonb, false, false, 'fq_shard_100', false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 98)
