values ('fq_shard_100', 'The Shard Begins to Wake', 'story', 'SS', 'CHILDREN_OF_THE_SHARD', 'SANCTUM', 'Oracle Seraphel''s final vision, delivered to the full Sanctum congregation with Elder Malakor standing silent beside her: the Shard stirs in its sacred sleep for the first time since the Great Severance. Not fully awake — not yet — but aware, the way a dreamer becomes aware of light through closed eyelids. Everything the Children of the Shard have done — every act of purification, every sacred duty, every wave of Reavers cleared, every Jotunn guided to rest, every Specter released — has been preparing this moment. Return to the Sanctum. Witness what you helped begin. Quest giver: High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber.', '{"npc_id": "npc_high_priest", "name": "Oracle Seraphel", "location": "SANCTUM"}'::jsonb, '{"min_level": 99, "reputation_required": 3395, "required_quests": ["fq_shard_099"]}'::jsonb, '[{"type": "travel", "target": "SANCTUM", "count": 1, "description": "Return as Avatar Abadi. (Travel to: Sanctum)"}, {"type": "interact", "target": "npc_high_priest", "count": 1, "description": "Receive Elder Malakor''s eternal blessing. (High Priestess Lyr at Sanctum Inner Chamber)"}]'::jsonb, '{"exp": 50000, "currency": 25000, "crd": 0, "rep": 10000, "items": [{"item_id": "resonanted_astral_phase_crystal", "quantity": 5}], "reputation": 5}'::jsonb, false, false, NULL, false, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'quest_shard.json', 99)
